e.torrent","source":"metadata","btih":"21f2285dcb87ad9ba44ceeea68ab0753a309ffb4","mtime":"1534572572","size":"5871","md5":"343064c127b98ea156ad8d70e2c80b52","crc32":"4fd5fd62","sha1":"38a2de608f613c6d584d0d975d98b5c52937b196","format":"Archive BitTorrent"},{"name":"radia_s11_n104_campus_files.xml","source":"original","format":"Metadata","md5":"dde1b57ccda42f1d1be47fad77d8c87e","summation":"md5"},{"name":"radia_s11_n104_campus_meta.sqlite","source":"original","mtime":"1493324674","size":"26624","format":"Metadata","md5":"bae8fcf6dc563fa4e87f23e6f6b4cb54","crc32":"fdeddf8f","sha1":"64c417d29aba53861eca7bd10473eb2c748f8900"},{"name":"radia_s11_n104_campus_meta.xml","source":"original","mtime":"1668006414","size":"3544","format":"Metadata","md5":"e045b946713fca3feb175c87539bed80","crc32":"e5b0043e","sha1":"81e10a1bb54dfdd0ee3285aefd466652fe616cb6"},{"name":"radia_s11_n104_campus_spectrogram.png","source":"derivative","format":"Spectrogram","original":"radia_s11_n104_campus.ogg","mtime":"1493324818","size":"330083","md5":"519c4593f964a6b5015bc32df9078b23","crc32":"cb80aee5","sha1":"461462a9dbc9d34d4fb2ca32d4ae1aa3d5975ad2"}],"files_count":12,"item_last_updated":1668006414,"item_size":76126039,"metadata":{"identifier":"radia_s11_n104_campus","mediatype":"audio","collection":["radiafm","radioprograms","radiostationarchives"],"description":"<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>there are two versions of this program.<br /><a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20080503234834/http://radioswap2.ulb.ac.be/programme.php/001pr1587\" rel=\"nofollow\">english</a><br /><a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20080503234834/http://radioswap2.ulb.ac.be/programme.php/001pr1588\" rel=\"nofollow\">français</a></p>\n<p><strong>Gérard Clamart’s strange adventure</strong></p>\n<p>It is the dawn of the 22nd century, somewhere in the Brussels city district.</p>\n<p>The central administration sends Gérard Clamart on an investigation.</p>\n<p>What seems at first to be a simple formality will reveal itself to be a<br />\ntrip down the past.</p>\n<p>Radia and Radio Campus BXL propose the first episode of :</p>\n<p>“Gérard Clamart’s strange adventure”</p>\n<p>with the voices of : Michel Villée & Tamara Joukovsky</p>\n<p>written by Irvic D’Olivier with Fabienne laumonier & Sebastian<br />\nDicenaire.</p>\n<p>Translation by : Olivier Taymans</p>\n<p>Recorded, edited and mixed by: Irvic D’Olivier</p>\n<p>Additional sounds : Jacques Foschia, Christophe Rault, Ritz, Raymond<br />\nScott, Brian Eno.</p>\n<p>With the help of l’atelier de création sonore radiophonique (acsr).<br />\nThanks to Etienne Noiseau.</p>\n<p>Language: English, French</p>\n<p>=========</p>\n<p><strong>Une étrange aventure de Gérard Clamart</strong></p>\n<p>A l’aube du XXIIe siècle, quelque part dans le district de<br />\nBruxelles Ville,<br />\nL’administration centrale confie à Gérard Clamart une enquête.</p>\n<p>Ce qui semblait être une formalité se révélera un voyage à travers<br />\nles siècles passés.</p>\n<p>Radia et Radio Campus BXL vous proposent d’écouter le premier épisode de:</p>\n<p>“Une étrange aventure de Gérard Clamart”</p>\n<p>Voix : Pierre Sartenaer et Tamara Joukovsky</p>\n<p>Scénario: Irvic D’Olivier avec Fabienne laumonier et Sebastian<br />\nDicenaire.</p>\n<p>Prise de son, montage et mixage: Irvic D’Olivier</p>\n<p>Sons additionnels : Jacques Foschia, Christophe Rault, Ritz, Raymond<br />\nScott, Brian Eno.</p>\n<p>avec l’aide de l’atelier de création sonore radiophonique (acsr).<br />\nmerci à Etienne Noiseau.</p>\n<p>Language: French</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","radiaseason":"11","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":"radio art;Radia;Radio Campus","title":"Show 0104: Gérard Clamart’s strange adventure by Irvic D’Olivier (Radio Campus)","publicdate":"2017-04-27 20:21:11","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","addeddate":"2017-04-27 20:21:11","creator":"Radio Campus","date":"2007-03-26","backup_location":"ia906403_3"},"server":"ia601507.us.archive.org","uniq":76627261,"workable_servers":["ia601507.us.archive.org","ia801507.us.archive.org"]}